<title>UK: Mediocredito Lombardo sets 150 bln lire 5-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Mediocredito Lombardo sets 150 bln lire 5-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Cariplo and J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MEDIOCREDITO LOMBARDO S.P.A</p>
<p> AMT    150 BLN LIRE  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    28.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *+40 BP    PAY DATE    28.JUL.97</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  100.02    REOFFER    99.55     FULL FEES   55 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ITALY     MGT/UND    8 BP	SELL CONC   47 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *IF 3M LIBOR FIXES BETWEEN 8.5 PCT AND 4.25 PCT OR</p>
<p>		3 PCT IF FIXED ELSEWHERE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
